            "title_size": "xl",
            "text": "<h4>A refined design</h4>\n\nSoftly sculpted curved legs introduce a refined sense of sophistication, serving as a distinctive design feature while maintaining exceptional strength and stability.\n\n<h4>Contemporary finishes</h4>\n\nOffered in several handpicked finishes, allowing for greater design flexibility, creating a tailored, personalised feel while ensuring the piece sits beautifully within both classic and contemporary spaces.\n\n<h4>Ergonomics front and centre </h4>\n\nModern, streamlined handles crafted with smooth, softened edges for a seamless touch, they offer both comfort and sophistication, with a generous 203mm length ensuring effortless usability.",
